      "rev_n_2_6403ec_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_6403ec_1",
        "node_id": "n_2_6403ec",
        "thought_text": "The current approach is inefficient and leads to incorrect results due to the way it generates and counts sequences. Instead, we can use a more direct method based on combinatorics and the properties of the valid sequences. The key insight is to calculate the number of valid sequences for each prefix and use this to navigate the sequence space efficiently, avoiding the need to generate all sequences explicitly.",
